== Walkthrough ==

This quest is given by [[Guard Valon]] at the toll booth in the Commonlands. You must have atleast Indifferent faction with the Freeport Militia in order to receive it. 

The '''[[Orc Picks]]''' quest (also given by Valon) is the prerequisite for the Cutthroat Rings quest.

'''After handing in 4 [[Orc Pawn Pick]]...'''

: Guard Valon Says, 'You have done well. Keep up the good work and we may trust you to [hunt dervish cutthroats] which in turn will allow you to join the Reserve Freeport Militia.

You Say, 'I want to hunt dervish cutthroats'

'''You'll receive an 8-slot container called [[Bag for Cutthroat Rings]].'''

'''[[Cutthroat Insignia Ring]]s are dropped pretty commonly from dervish cutthroats located in the West Commonlands and North and South Ro.'''

'''Combine them in the container and turn in the result to Guard Valon.'''

<div class='facblock'>
* Your faction standing with [[Coalition of Tradefolk Underground]] has gotten better.
* Your faction standing with [[Freeport Militia]] has gotten better.
* Your faction standing with [[Knights of Truth]] has gotten worse.
* Your faction standing with [[Priests of Marr]] has gotten worse.
</div>

You also receive a [[Militia Armory Token]] for use in the [[Reserve Militia]] quest.

